sequenceDiagram
    participant Consumer as API Consumer
    participant GW as Guardrails Server<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS<br/>TLS 1.2+ (optional)
    participant Chunker as Chunker Services<br/>8085/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS (optional)
    participant Detector as Detector Services<br/>8080/TCP REST<br/>TLS (optional)
    participant TGIS as TGIS Generation<br/>8033/TCP gRPC<br/>No encryption
    participant DetHealth as Detector Health<br/>8081/TCP REST
    participant Probe as Platform / Probe
    participant HealthSvr as Health Server<br/>8034/TCP HTTP<br/>No TLS

    Note over Consumer,GW: Flow 1: Guardrails Request Processing

    Consumer->>GW: POST /api/v1/* or /api/v2/*<br/>Auth: Passthrough headers
    Note right of GW: Extract configured headers<br/>Optional: rewrite<br/>X-Forwarded-Access-Token<br/>→ Authorization Bearer

    par Fan-out to downstream services
        GW->>Chunker: gRPC request<br/>Text segmentation<br/>TLS optional
        GW->>Detector: REST request<br/>Content analysis<br/>Bearer token (optional)
        GW->>TGIS: gRPC request<br/>Text generation<br/>No encryption
    end

    Chunker-->>GW: Chunked text segments
    Detector-->>GW: Detection results
    TGIS-->>GW: Generated text

    Note right of GW: Combine detection +<br/>generation results

    GW-->>Consumer: Combined response<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    Note over Probe,HealthSvr: Flow 2: Health Check

    Probe->>HealthSvr: GET /health<br/>8034/TCP, No auth
    HealthSvr->>DetHealth: Health probe<br/>8081/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    DetHealth-->>HealthSvr: Health status
    HealthSvr-->>Probe: Aggregate health response
